Inclusion Criteria:

1 . Fully understand the purpose, nature, procedures of the study and possible adverse reactions, voluntarily participate in the study, and sign the informed consent form (ICF) before any study procedures begin; 2. Healthy male or female participants aged ≥18 years; 3. Male weight ≥ 50.0 kg, female weight ≥ 45.0 kg; body mass index (BMI) in the range of 18.5 to 24.9 kg/m2 (inclusive); 4. Participants voluntarily agree to use effective contraception during the study and for 3 months after the last dose, and have no plans to conceive or father a child, donate sperm, or donate eggs during that period; 5. Able to communicate well with the investigator and understand and comply with all requirements of this study.

Exclusion Criteria:

