11. Use of prescription medication within 14 days prior to dosing and 7 days prior to dosing for over the counter medication/vitamins/herbal supplements (with the exception of contraception, occasional paracetamol \< 2g/day, and standard dose of multivitamins).
12. Consumption of alcohol, caffeinated products (coffee, tea, cola, chocolate), grapefruit fruits, or products containing grapefruit within 48 hours prior to dosing;
13. Consumption of any poppy seeds (e.g., orange and poppy seed muffin, poppy seed bread) within 48 hours prior to screening and admission.
